          "locator": "§2.3，证据验证段",
          "adoption": "另写递归枚举和BigDecimal重算的验证器，不调用选择器evaluate/select自证。"
        },
        {
          "key": "E03_retention",
          "page": 4,
          "anchor": "The smallest verified",
          "locator": "§2.4，Staged refinement段",
          "adoption": "保留已验证有效组合；新提案未验证通过时不覆盖旧有效结果。"
        },
        {
          "key": "E04_unresolved",
          "page": 5,
          "anchor": "The outputs distinguish certified retention",
          "locator": "§2.4续，三类结果与验证范围",
          "adoption": "未知与不成立分开；差额只解释有限推荐评分模型。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceId": "M002",
      "title": "Certifying Expected Cost Differences Between Target Confirmation Policies via Joint First-Hit Compatibility",
